{
  "name": "支付",
  "description": "ruoyi-common-pay 父模块（含 5 个子模块: core/wechat/alipay/unionpay/balance） + 各处 pom 引用",
  "delete_dirs": [
    "ruoyi-common/ruoyi-common-pay"
  ],
  "delete_files": [],
  "remove_pom_lines": [
    {
      "file": "ruoyi-common/pom.xml",
      "patterns": [
        "<module>ruoyi-common-pay</module>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "ruoyi-modules/ruoyi-business/pom.xml",
      "patterns": [
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-core</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-wechat</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-alipay</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-unionpay</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-balance</artifactId>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "ruoyi-modules/ruoyi-mall/pom.xml",
      "patterns": [
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-core</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-wechat</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-alipay</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-unionpay</artifactId>",
        "<artifactId>ruoyi-common-pay-balance</artifactId>"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "manual_actions": [
    "⚠️ 实测发现：单独裁 pay 会编译失败！ruoyi-mall 模块的 OrderPayController 和 PayNotifyController 引用了支付类",
    "⚠️ 必须组合裁剪：/strip-modules mall pay（先 mall 后 pay 同一次执行）",
    "从 script/sql/ry_plus_new.sql 移除支付相关菜单和字典初始化（搜索 '支付'、pay_）",
    "删除 application.yml / application-dev.yml 中 pay 相关配置（如 wxpay/alipay 商户配置）"
  ],
  "depends_on": ["mall"]
}
